--- stdout

Usage: buncargo build [<app>...] [options]

Run apps' buildCommand one at a time

Arguments:
  <app>  Only these apps

Options:
  --discovered   Only apps found by discoverApps()
  --apps=<apps>  Only these apps (as <app>...)
  --help, -h     Show this help message

Exit codes:
