"exit 0
--- stdout

Usage: buncargo hosts <command>

Named .localhost URLs

Commands:
  install    One-time CA + :443 proxy (non-interactive)
  status     Daemon health, CA, and active routes
  sync       Rewrite the /etc/hosts buncargo block
  prune      Drop routes whose owner process is gone
  uninstall  Remove named hosts from this machine
  daemon     Run the loopback HTTPS proxy in the foreground

Without a command: Daemon health, CA, and active routes

Options:
  --help, -h  Show this help message

Exit codes:
  0  success
  1  failed, or bad arguments

Run "bunx buncargo hosts <command> --help" for a command's options.


--- stderr
"
`;

